# Binaries and build outputs
bin/
dist/
.memql-ci/
.memql-security/
__pycache__/
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test artifacts
*.test
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Go workspace file (per-developer, not shared)
go.work
go.work.sum

# Editor / debug
__debug*
.idea/
.vscode/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Local env override (see memql/component/genesis/localenv.go).
# Each developer's values are theirs; production binaries don't
# carry a .env at all.
.env
.env.local

# Claude Code project state. OPT IN, NOT OPT OUT, as in the engine repo
# (memql#3344): `.claude/` is ignored wholesale and only what should travel
# with the project is negated back in, so a new kind of state stays private
# by default instead of sitting in `git status` until someone notices.
# epics/ and prds/ (CCPM working state) stay ignored deliberately: CCPM syncs
# them to GitHub Issues, and the local files churn every session.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/settings.json

# Never shared, whatever the negations above may later allow.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/worktrees/
